# Lazarus split-only patch for FlyTheElephant1/datum_gateway
# branch test/console-collapse-pr14-pr17 at 121edd06244082df2aa101f3b3c424faed8dd31b
#
# That tree already hashes the pool's payout coinbase (type 4) on BLAKE2b jobs
# instead of type 0. This patch closes the remaining empty-first holes and
# sets the hello UA so Lazarus Prime will accept the connection.
#
#   git clone -b test/console-collapse-pr14-pr17 https://github.com/FlyTheElephant1/datum_gateway.git
#   cd datum_gateway
#   patch -p1 < datum-gateway-split-only.patch
#   cmake . && make
#
# Hello UA becomes v0.4.1-beta+lazarus-split so Prime accepts it when
# require-split-gateway is on. Stock OCEAN / unpatched FlyTheElephant1
# (UA v0.4.1-beta) is refused.
#
# While pooled this:
#   - skips JOB_STATE_EMPTY_PLUS (no empty-first jobs)
#   - does not fall back to an empty coinbase if the coinbaser is empty/slow
#   - copies the type-4 split into type 0 so "tiny" firmware still pays TIDES
#   - disables the 5s coinbaser timeout that would otherwise publish empty work
#   - never sends type-0 mining.notify on pooled BLAKE2b jobs
#   - sends clean_jobs=true on the first split notify of a new height
#
